{"condensed":"Vuetify component style overrides configuration defining the visual appearance of buttons, text inputs, dialogs, expansion panels, navigation, tooltips and error states in the application.

Buttons: `.v-btn` strips minimum width, text transformation, normalizes letter spacing and adds 0.25rem margin between icons and text. `.button-blue` creates a blue outlined button with $app-blue color on transparent background. Text field labels transform up 8px and scale to 0.75 when active. Dialogs apply 2rem margin, card titles use 1.5em font in $BCgovBlue5 background with $BCgovFontColorInverted color, card text uses 300 font weight in $gray7. Expansion panels remove default box-shadow; `.align-items-top` aligns expand icon to flex-start; `.no-dropdown-icon` hides the icon via `display: none`. Navigation icons add 1rem right margin. Error states override Vuetify defaults: `.error` and related classes apply $app-red to background, border, text and caret; specificity enforced via `.v-application.app-container` selector. Tooltips set 270px width, RGB(73,80,87) background with white text, 4px border-radius, $px-12 font size; pseudo-element `:after` draws right-side arrow; `.top-tooltip:after` draws top-pointing arrow. Disabled text buttons set 0.4 opacity and $app-blue color on icon and text.

GOTCHA: Error colour overrides use high specificity selectors (`.v-application.app-container .error`) to force override of Vuetify defaults; this approach is fragile to DOM structure changes. Tooltip arrow positioning uses absolute positioning with hard-coded pixel values (10px, 8px margins) which may break if content padding changes.","defines":[".v-btn",".button-blue",".v-text-field--box .v-label--active",".v-text-field--full-width .v-label--active",".v-text-field--outline .v-label--active",".v-dialog",".v-expansion-panel",".v-expansion-panel.align-items-top",".v-expansion-panel-header.no-dropdown-icon",".v-application--is-ltr .v-list-item__icon:first-child",".v-application.app-container .error",".v-application.app-container .error--text",".v-tooltip__content",".v-tooltip__content:after",".top-tooltip:after",".theme--light.v-btn.v-btn--disabled.v-btn--text"],"uses":[{"name":"theme.scss","direction":"reads","what":"$app-blue, $app-red, $BCgovBlue5, $BCgovFontColorInverted, $gray7, $px-12 - theme colour and sizing variables."},{"name":"Vuetify","direction":"reads","what":"Component classes and structure (.v-btn, .v-dialog, .v-card, .v-text-field, .v-expansion-panel, .v-tooltip, .v-list-item, .v-icon, .v-label, .v-btn--contained, .v-btn--disabled, .v-btn--text) that these overrides modify via CSS cascade."},{"name":"RGB and RGBA","direction":"reads","what":"Colour functions: RGB(73,80,87) for tooltip background, RGBA(73,80,87,0.95) for arrow pseudo-elements."}]}

