odes ACTIVE, COMPLETED."},{"name":"PaymentMethod enum","direction":"reads","what":"INTERNAL.value for CFS account lookup."},{"name":"capture_message","direction":"sends","what":"Error reporting with account id, routing slip id, error message and level='error'."},{"name":"current_app.logger","direction":"sends","what":"Logs info, debug and error messages throughout."}]}

